    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Built-In Blades & Bare-Knuckle Brawling</h2><p>A Mantid close-combat package using bare-knuckle strikes and biological chitin forearm blades.</p><p><strong>Bare-Knuckle Strike:</strong> 1d6 bludgeoning.</p><p><strong>Chitin Blade:</strong> 1d8 slashing.</p><p><strong>Twin Blade Flurry:</strong> Make two 1d6 slashing attacks. The second attack is launched automatically.</p><p><strong>Raking Lunge:</strong> Move up to 10 ft toward the target, then make a 1d8 slashing attack; this movement does not provoke from that target.</p><p><strong>Mantis Guard:</strong> Reaction, gain +2 AC against the triggering melee attack for 1 round.</p>",
      "chat": "<p></p>"
    },
